	(text "Coil RX winding is AC-coupled and DC-biased to VOCM through 100k. BAS416 clamps to VOCM protect the preamp from PI flyback coupling (recovers < 2 us)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "352c3a85-4480-4d73-8dc6-1e0557d0f788")
	)
	(text "VOCM = 2.5 V * 10k/(10k+5.11k) = 1.654 V = AVDD/2 of the ADC.  OPA1656 B is an unused unit (follower on GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 394.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "794239c4-a0b0-48a1-9a37-bd4428de5fff")
	)
	(text "Full scale at ADC (+-2.5 V diff) corresponds to +-125 mV at the coil - the 24-bit ADC gives >110 dB headroom so no AGC is needed in any soil."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "90aad3b9-e5e3-4d1e-9ecd-d08ee1f1245d")
	)
	(text "RX FRONT END  (OPA1612 in-amp topology, 1.1 nV/rtHz, gain 20; THS4551 fully-differential ADC drivers; VOCM = 1.65 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9e6bb375-875b-4767-aeeb-ff62e75c66e4")
	)
	(text "Differential gain = 1 + 2*1k/105R = 20.0 ; common-mode gain 1 (subtracted by the FDA).  Input-referred noise ~2.3 nV/rtHz incl. 47R and coil resistance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f4acd43b-b32b-4615-a894-9c143af66f3d")
	)
